[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i373"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"由于我们昨晚已经确认到古文书内容有变化，于是也来看看慰灵碑的情况。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么，来看看吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12750"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"查看刻在慰灵碑上的遇难者人数。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12783"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“怎么样，羽依里？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……变少了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“变成37人了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12743"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“真的吗!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12753"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“之前是，唔……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“52人。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也就是说又少了15人。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“一开始有78人，到现在已经少了41人！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12746"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这简直太棒了啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们又笑着想要击一下掌。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12789"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“不……还是别了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识放下了举在半空中的手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“为什么啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12750"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“还有37人没能得救。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12773"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“没心没肺地高兴感觉不太合适。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这倒也是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然我觉得有人得救，这本身也是值得高兴的一件事。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12777"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“还是等彻底没有人遇难的时候再高兴吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……说得对。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识的目标是拯救岛上的所有人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我只是在帮助她实现这个目标。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"先集中精力做成这一件事吧。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i427"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"吹来一阵舒适的海风。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和识想出来的计划正在一点点地开花结果。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识好像对此很高兴，我也是。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，最近莫名……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没错，总觉得莫名有些异样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也具体说不上是哪里不对劲。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就是那种若有若无的不自然感。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i25"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……嗯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然，手上感到了一阵温暖。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12821"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯嘿嘿……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"原来是识握住了我的手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12839"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“也没怎么啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识的脸颊微红，笑着抬头看着我。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12854"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“要是不想的话，我就松开了哦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……不想？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么会呢，识。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，我改变了手的牵法。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1714"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“哦……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将手指互相交错扣在一起，十指紧扣。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也就是所谓恋人的牵法。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明是自己主动这么牵的，却还是有点害羞。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，识露出了笑容。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1717"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯嘿嘿……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“又连结在了一起呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊，这就是御结。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识开心地笑着走在路上，同时用力摆着牵在一起的手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她还是那么像小孩子。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1714"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“别人会怎么看我们呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那大概会觉得是……”"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"恋人吧？","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"家人吧？","value":1,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":104,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“恋人吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我大胆地试探道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"偷偷瞥了识一眼，想看看她是什么反应。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1717"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这、这个嘛……可能也不坏呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"反应还不错。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，识又深吸了一口气，像是在调整心情似的。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1714"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“搞不好人家会觉得是姐弟呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来如此。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从相牵的手上传来的温度，能感觉到她是在掩饰自己的害羞。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以我也就没再追问了。"},{"op":"goto","target":113},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“家人吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“喂喂，羽依里，这想法也太大胆了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊，确实有点勉强了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“真是的，居然说我有这么大的儿子，真的好失礼哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？原来你是家长啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯嘿嘿。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识露出了顽皮的笑容。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“至少也得是姐弟吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好吧，这还像那么回事。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1716"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“真是的，有个不成器的弟弟真的很头疼哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等等。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这设定是不是有点太牵强了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1717"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯嘿嘿。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊……可恶，她真可爱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渔夫A","text":"“喂――！小哥还有鬼妹妹！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1714"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“噢……是之前那位渔夫。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从沙滩那边，那位经常见面的渔夫叫了我们一声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“喂――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识应着渔夫，用力挥了挥和我牵在一起的手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这让我有点害羞。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渔夫A","text":"“小哥啊，你们要海螺吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“羽依里，是海螺耶！他好像要给我们海螺呢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊――”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，我猜这肯定不会是白送的……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渔夫A","text":"“那就再来帮忙干活吧！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渔夫A","text":"“不劳动者不得食！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我就知道。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这世界可不会天上掉馅饼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过一旦提到干活的话，识就会――"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1716"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“包在我身上，不管是打扫卫生还是什么，我都能轻松搞定。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1714"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“走吧，羽依里！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你要帮忙吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“毕竟能拿到海螺不是吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“虽然确实能……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你那不想干活的病已经治好了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“我当然不想干活了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她斩钉截铁地说道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“不过，你也会陪我一起干的对吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，那肯定会。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1716"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“那么这就不算是劳动啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“因为会很开心的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1714"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“来，我们走吧！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识拉着我的手，朝着通往沙滩的台阶跑去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我很想能一直这样牵着她的手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"同时我也意识到了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"原来我是把识当作女孩子来看待的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯？怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没什么。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，这种感情并不坏。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":1},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":176,"value":["==",["v",6003],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":381,"target":2},{"op":"goto","target":242},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":179,"value":["==",["v",6003],2]},{"op":"callScene","scene":380,"target":2},{"op":"goto","target":242},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i62"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我们回来了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12815"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“回来咯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15458"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“欢迎回来。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15560"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“哇，那是海螺吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“是从哪里搞来的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12777"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未看到我手上的网兜里装满了海螺，一下愣住了。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15337"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……是偷捕来的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这次不是。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15350"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“这次？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，我可从没干过偷捕这种事啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15387"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，没什么。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了维护识的名誉，我还是不说了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12789"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯嘿嘿，是帮忙捕鱼后人家分给我们的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对，是劳动的报酬。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12743"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“我们把海螺的壳擦得干干净净，苔藓也都清理掉了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12740"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“处理这个还蛮有意思的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还帮忙搬了打捞上来的海螺。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过，海螺实在是太沉了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15375"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“话说回来，量真的好多啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“大家一起吃吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那就要做海螺炒饭了呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？啊，嗯，嗯……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这东西也要做进炒饭吗？"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15375"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那么，作为谢礼，我要送给你们这个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12783"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……烟花套装？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她递过来一个装有各种烟花的套装。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这是哪里来的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15325"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“是做广播体操时拿到的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这岛上广播体操的奖品都是些什么啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也好，算是夏日回忆套装吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那，干脆今晚就去放烟花吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“啊，我就不参加了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？但是，这东西是给羽未的，你也一起来嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我要早点睡，你们就不用管我了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15375"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“而且也算是海螺的谢礼。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12740"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“谢谢你啊，羽未。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“不用谢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么，等天黑了就去放烟花吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12743"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“可以啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……对了。既然如此，要不要也叫上良一他们？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“烟花果然还是人多点一起放比较开心。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12746"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯！就这么办！”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i50"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在我的邀请下，岛上少年团的大家都聚了过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我、识、良一、天善、野美希……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽因为要忙着准备夏鸟之仪，所以缺席。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦，苍呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“应该快来了吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10200"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“让你们久等了――”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍抱着纸袋出现了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“那是什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10196"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“是烟花哦。老奶奶让我带过来的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那是要卖的吧？真的可以吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10405"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“夏日的回忆……是无价的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10389"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“她是这么说的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11728"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样啊，那就心怀感激地收下吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“都带了些什么样的烟花？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10243"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“让我看看……有钻地鼠和窜天猴。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10274"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“还有连发的那种，礼花弹，还有烟雾弹……”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“喔，还有蛇炮啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12903"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“蛇炮是什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“识你不知道吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“干脆演示一下如何。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12159"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“一上来就要放蛇炮啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11693"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“这也别有一番风情。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1025,"image":"i10200"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这个就是蛇炮哦。也有人叫蛇蛋。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12896"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“看上去就是个黑乎乎的块状物啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你看着就知道了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12880"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍把蛇炮放在沙滩上，点燃了它。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12167"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“危险，识！快趴下！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12883"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“哎？哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12152"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“不想死的话就马上趴下！快！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12893"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“哇哇!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听到良一的话，识立刻趴到了地上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"蛇炮伴随着一阵嗤嗤声，逐渐显露出它的真面目。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"黑色的燃烧残渣像蛇一样，一扭一扭地越伸越长。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仅此而已，是一种极为朴素的烟花。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这就是蛇炮。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12903"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这就是……蛇炮？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12896"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这有什么危险――……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12883"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"环顾了一下四周，识总算反应过来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"趴在地上的只有她一个人，包括我在内的其他人都在看着她，捧腹大笑。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12909"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“你、你们骗我！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12910"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“大家也太过分了吧！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12159"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“哎呀～真是精彩的反应。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11740"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“没想到你真的是第一次见啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“不过，反射神经确实厉害。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12888"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“呜哎……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“觉得怎么样？蛇炮。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12897"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“感觉会是我最讨厌的烟花了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10285"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“抱歉抱歉。那么，接下来就来正常放烟花吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那就先玩我带来的这些吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我拆开了岛民送给羽未的那套烟花。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"里面大多数都是些很常规的手持式烟花。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12974"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“识，给你。拿着这个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12970"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“……这次应该不用趴下了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“别那么提防嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10200"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12947"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那我点火了哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍点燃了识手中的烟花。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着，伴随着噼里啪啦的声音，火花开始四溅。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12903"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“噢噢……！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12874"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“火花变换着好几种颜色！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12870"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这样的烟花我还是第一次见！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10146"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“第一次？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10118"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“识，你以前没放过烟花吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12900"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“不，烟花当然还是放过的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12876"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“但是像这么漂亮的是第一次看到。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她双眼闪闪发亮地盯着手持烟花头部喷射出的火花。"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“我们也来放吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大家都拿起了一根烟花，轮流将其点燃。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"原本昏暗的海滩，因为这么多人一起放烟花，现在变得相当明亮。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12874"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“噢噢噢噢噢――！好亮――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识也兴奋不已。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到她这个样子，良一他们也露出了笑容。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10200"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“识，你能念出来这个吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍挥动着点燃的烟花，在空中用光芒写下文字。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12902"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“我。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12902"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“叫。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12902"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“做。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12902"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“空。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12902"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“门。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12875"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“葱。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10221"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“是苍！最后绝对是故意念错的吧！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“下一个换我来。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15149"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“识，看你能不能读出这个！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12902"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“乒。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12902"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“乓。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12902"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“王。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12902"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“小。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12879"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“求。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12173"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“乒乓王小球。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11730"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“那是谁啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15017"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“不是，我只是想写乒乓球来着。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10278"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“接下来要放哪个呢，小球？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“随便你挑哦，小球。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15026"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“怎么好像变成我的外号了!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15017"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“但是……这股在胸中涌动的热潮是怎么回事？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15149"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“我是……小球，乒乓球之王小球！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12939"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“天善前辈，快选接下来要放的烟花吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15096"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“啊……还是叫前辈比较好……”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":769},{"op":"clear","layer":1025},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i50"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"手持式烟花放完之后，我们又玩起了苍带过来的特制烟花。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“好嘞，气氛正好热闹起来了，继续放不要停下来！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"烟花总能让人兴奋起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"兴致高涨的我们，开始做起了一些傻事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"用手枪形状的烟花，上演起了你射我我射你的小剧场……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10352"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12168"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“砰！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12211"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“呃啊!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12147"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“唔……我被打中了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12148"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“良一！振作点！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12151"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“羽依里……我已经不行了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“但是，可不要为我报仇哦……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12148"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“报仇这种事……只会徒增空虚……而已……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“良一!؟”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i512"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“良一――――――――！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11768"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你们还真能演啊……”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i50"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识手上拿着连发烟花，对准了天善。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15125"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"天善则举着球拍站在发射口前。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12882"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“真、真的要来吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11770"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“本来这种危险行为是应该禁止的，但这是他本人的意愿。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12873"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“那么……接招――――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嗖！嗖！嗖！嗖!!"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15149"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“嘿！”"},{"op":"set","variable":26027,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“哈！”"},{"op":"set","variable":26027,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“呼！”"},{"op":"set","variable":26027,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“嚯！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12873"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“噢噢！每次击中都会让火花四溅，好漂亮！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10329"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这画面可不能让岛上的孩子们看到呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15096"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“哼……就这种程度吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15093"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“看来也算不得是什么特训啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12873"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“好，那接下来两根一起来！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15113"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“……什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识双手各持一根连发烟花，苍和野美希几乎同时点燃了它们。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两个火球以微小的时间差袭向天善！"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15149"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“呼！哈！”"},{"op":"set","variable":26027,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“哼！嚯！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“噢噢，他真的把两发都拦下来了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15140"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“嘿！好烫!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15137"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“哈！好烫!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渐渐地他开始捉襟见肘了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15149"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“好烫!؟好烫!؟好痛!؟好烫!؟烫死了!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10318"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这还真是不能让岛上的孩子们看到的画面了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"烟花不能对着人放。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是理所当然的。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i50"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“说到烟花，果然还得是这个啊！钻地鼠！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"良一点燃老鼠花，扔到了大家中间。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12165"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“快跑啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大家都想到了它在脚边疯狂转圈的样子，纷纷后退拉开了距离。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是……"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12149"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“咦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在沙地上，钻地鼠完全没有转动起来……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12893"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“呜哎!؟爆炸了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“看来是失败了啊。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i50"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12165"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“说到烟花，果然还得是这个啊！礼花弹！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"良一重整旗鼓，点燃了放在沙地上的喷射型烟花。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12880"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这是会升空的烟花吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，是那种喷射型的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“火花会往上喷，非常漂亮的哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12870"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“那我可要好好期待了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12903"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没有喷射。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“咦……好怪啊。这是哑炮吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10117"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“是不是没点着啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“不，应该不会吧……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"良一走过去想要查看一下。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11711"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“啊，笨蛋。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12168"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“哇啊!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"良一被突然冒出的火花吓了一跳，一屁股坐在了地上。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12153"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“好危险！差点就要烫伤了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15014"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“玩礼花弹常见的情况之一啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10285"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“确实常见呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12168"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“你们倒是关心关心我啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哈哈哈……”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12947"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识在一旁，脸上浮现出呆滞的表情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么了？你也被吓到了吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12961"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯，算是……被吓到了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12959"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“隔一段时间才发射，挺吓人的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12948"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“还有像刚才钻地鼠那样，会发出很大声音的也很吓人。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i238"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":769},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12949"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……你那个时代有什么样的？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我小声问道。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12904"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“虽然也有这种会喷出来的烟花，但没有这么多颜色。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12906"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“所以觉得很惊讶呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看她的样子，与其说是感到惊讶，倒不如说像是在思考着什么……"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i50"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11696"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“那么，差不多该收尾了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10394"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“最后当然要玩这个了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，苍开始给大家分发烟花。"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12903"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这是……秸秆牡丹烟花？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10200"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你居然知道这么古老的名字啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识盯着秸秆尖端的那团黑色火药。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1720"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听到了一点微小得几乎要被海浪声淹没的声音。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而我们则目不转睛地望着这微小的火光。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“……这种形式的烟花，一直都没变过啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有这个吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“在我的时代也有的哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识带着几分怀念地，注视着线香花火的火球。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“大家知道吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这种烟花，在以前是像线香一样插在香炉里观赏的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“原来如此，所以才叫线香花火啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“线香花火燃烧的各个阶段，分别都是有叫法的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“一开始像是球一样的状态，叫做‘花蕾’。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“顾名思义，是因为它现在很像花蕾的样子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1721"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“当花蕾消融，开始溅射出火花时，叫做‘牡丹’。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这是把它比作为灿烂盛开的牡丹花。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"四散的火花燃烧得更为剧烈了。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1720"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这是‘松叶’。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“因为火花向四面八方飞散的样子很像松针。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大家注视着线香眼花，一言不发地认真聆听着识的讲解。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“当火势开始减弱时，就是‘柳’。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“现在它是不是很像垂柳？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“然后……火球落下前瞬间的这个状态。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1721"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“叫做‘落菊’。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“菊花的花瓣是一片片地落下的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“此时的烟花，也正如那美丽的凋落之时。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不一会儿，大家的火球都陆续落在了沙子上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是，大家便一起观赏起了识手上那根还在燃烧的‘落菊’。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1720"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“虽然不知道是谁说的，不过有说法是这种烟花就像是在比喻人生呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“‘花蕾’象征着新生命的孕育，‘牡丹’象征着充满朝气孩童茁壮成长。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“‘松叶’象征着激情澎湃的壮年，‘柳叶’象征着与家人共度的静好时光。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“‘落菊’象征着回首往事的暮年……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这么想想的话，有没有觉得这种烟花格外特别呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大家虽然都温柔地微笑着，但气氛却变得有些伤感。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，这种氛围也是烟花的一部分。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听着海浪的声音，感受着仍残留着日间余温的微风――"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"闻着火药的气味和烟雾的香气，聆听着火花绽放的声音……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知道为什么，这一幕景象令我感到无比怀念。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"确实，我曾几何时感受过的夏日正是这副模样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"随后，识手中线香烟花的火球没有坠落，而是就那样静静地燃尽了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"暑假已经进入到了后半段。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i72"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12713"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“今天的，烟花，真开心，呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识一边在榻榻米上打滚一边对我说。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12693"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“要感谢，羽未，呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12696"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“还有，苍前辈，和大家。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也许是已经习惯了，又或是锻炼半规管有了成果。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知不觉中，她已经不会再说头晕了。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12650"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“还想，再放，烟花呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识一边滚动着身子，一边注视着画有饭团的文蛤护身符。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来她已经轻松到有心思做这种事了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，以后有机会吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我这么说着，打开了鸟白山海文书。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今天应该是没法抱太大期待的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毕竟除了帮渔夫的忙和放烟花之外，什么都没做。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"根本没有做什么对成为海盗鬼姫有帮助的事情――"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……不会吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12705"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“上面的内容又变了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12663"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“真的吗!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12660"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识蹦了起来，又贴在了我的背上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然又蹭到了各种部位，但现在已经顾不上在意这些了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……情况变得很不得了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“鬼姫威胁到了岛上的和平……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12632"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“哎？真的吗!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……上面写着用火绳枪恐吓了岛民。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12644"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“有、有没有人受伤!؟没有吧!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“如果只是恐吓的话，那应该还好吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“书上没有提到这方面的内容，所以不太清楚……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为什么古文书的内容会突然变了这么多？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样一来，真的就像是一个岛民会畏惧的鬼了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12638"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“……不，肯定没有人受伤。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊？你怎么知道？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12662"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“因为那是空包弹。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“空包弹？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12734"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“今天放烟花时我想到的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12729"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“巨大的声音会让人感到害怕。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12737"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“所以我就想，是不是可以用没有装弹的火绳枪来吓唬岛上的人。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来如此……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这就是你思考后得出的结论吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12734"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“持有强力武器的海盗来袭……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12737"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这给人的感觉很可怕吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那确实可怕。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毕竟是改变了战国时代的杀伤性武器，普通人根本无法与之抗衡吧。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12635"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯嘿嘿，看来我的思路没有错。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12660"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“鬼姬正在变得越来越可怕呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听着识的想法，我之前感到的那种莫名不对劲的感觉又加重了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这种感觉的本质，我也逐渐想明白了。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i260"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在古文书中，识在不断发生着改变。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"受到岛上居民宠爱的海盗鬼姬，逐渐变成了一个遭人厌恶的存在。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是识自己所期望的结果。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12716"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"实际上，眼前的识也确实笑得很开心。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是……这样下去真的好吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不自然感的本质，便是我内心产生的此番迷茫。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]